00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:55.680
And this brings us back to the tragedy of
Garps character.

00:07:55.680 --> 00:08:00.990
His inner divide between love towards his
family and duty towards the organization he

00:08:00.990 --> 00:08:02.660
believes to bring justice to the world.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:05.210
[Jon Snow]
We can see this divide very Cleary in the

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:09.279
the fact that garp has a very interesting
approach to dealing with pirates, which is

00:08:09.279 --> 00:08:13.960
judging them based on their actions and their
personality, as he is well aware of the dark

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:16.300
system overshadowing the marines.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:21.569
We know this, because garp doesn't make a
secret out of his disdain for the world nobles.

00:08:21.569 --> 00:08:26.850
in fact, the only reason he never accepted
any promotion above vice admiral was, because

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:31.469
the positions of admiral and fleet admiral
are under the direct command of the world

00:08:31.469 --> 00:08:32.469
government.

00:08:32.469 --> 00:08:37.330
As a result, similar to smoker and luffy started
to build an actual relationship with Roger

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:39.750
after chasing after him for many years.

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:44.291
In the end, their relationship was of such
mutual respect and understanding, that they

00:08:44.291 --> 00:08:50.220
not only fought together, Roger actually entrusted
garp with his precious child, telling him

00:08:50.220 --> 00:09:02.450
that he trusted him as much as his crew, which,
lets be honest is a real goosebump moment.

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.800
Whether he also told garp about his plans
and the knowledge he found on laugh tale remains

00:09:06.800 --> 00:09:12.690
to be seen, but garp was willing to accept
his old rivals request and took Ace in.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:18.420
Garp entrusts Ace to Dadan And some time later,
Luffy too, occasionally paying them visits

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:20.960
and hoping to shape them into future Marines.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:24.780
each have their own reason to become a pirate
and disobey him.

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:28.420
But this doesn’t change the fact that they
are family.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:32.330
He continues to pour his love on them, albeit
through fists of love.

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:37.310
And Garp wanting Ace And Luffy to become Marines
shoes us how much he actually respects his

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:42.240
job, no doubt hoping to make his boys part
of his new generation.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:48.730
And yet he keeps laughing whenever he hears
about luffs exploits in the world, even when

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:51.020
the marines are involved.

00:09:51.020 --> 00:09:56.000
And so its no real surprise that marineford
was not only the climax of luffys character

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:58.420
arc, but of grapes as well.

00:09:58.420 --> 00:10:03.990
When he sits next to his grandson, who is
about to be executed, There was not a hint

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:05.660
of a smile.

00:10:05.660 --> 00:10:08.020
Garp instead cries.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:12.830
Cries not only in sorrow of seeing his grandson
in such a situation, but cries because of

00:10:12.830 --> 00:10:15.450
his inability to do anything about it.

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.830
His life as a Marine tied his hands up.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:22.410
In the end, garp decides to choose duty.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:27.260
As he takes down Marco, who had no issues
dealing with the other admirals so far, he

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:29.450
boosts the morale of the marines.

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:35.220
And just moments later, he has to witness
Luffy, his second grandson, running towards

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.220
him.

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.320
The ultimate dilemma.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.670
Now he was standing in the way of one grandson
rescuing his other grandson.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:47.070
In this moment of turmoil, as he sees his
happy days with the boys pass before his eyes,

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:58.040
he gives himself up and allows Luffy to punch
him and pass.

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:02.700
And so I believe that the true reason Garp
is so incredibly enraged at akainu killing

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:08.310
ace, is that right from the start, he never
actually thought Ace was going to be executed.

00:11:08.310 --> 00:11:13.770
Instead, he fully expected Whitebeard and
his crew and later luffy would save Ace.

00:11:13.770 --> 00:11:18.910
As a result, we got one of the most emotional
and heartbreaking scenes in the story as Sengoku

00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:27.540
has to restrain him from murdering akainu.

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:31.960
And the same goes for his reaction to shanks
arriving, who was responsible for setting

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:34.570
luffy on the same path as ace.

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:38.200
And so on this day, Garp, the Marine won.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:40.410
But Garp, the man, lost.

00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:44.050
Now I personally would like to think, that
garp will have the chance to choose again

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:49.480
at some point in the future, so save his other
grandson or stay loyal to the marines.

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:53.130
And this time he will choose family over duty.

